   "text": "Owned 4 = on hand 3 + on rent 1 \u00b7 Available 2 = on hand 3 \u2212 reserved 1 \u00b7 Valuation 4 \u00d7 31,200 = AFN 124,800",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
