   "text": "Writes inventory_items (+ inventory_item_media).\nSKU auto-generated as ADF{YY}-{0000}. Stores lifecycle_status only \u2014\navailability stays derived. Saving creates NO stock and NO\ninventory_stock_transactions row: opening quantities arrive via\nManual stock entry (screen 8) or Receive PO (screen 9).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Writes inventory_items (+ inventory_item_media).\nSKU auto-generated as ADF{YY}-{0000}. Stores lifecycle_status only \u2014\navailability stays derived. Saving creates NO stock and NO\ninventory_stock_transactions row: opening quantities arrive via\nManual stock entry (screen 8) or Receive PO (screen 9).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
