   "updated": 1789320956557,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 2132541838,
   "text": "Landed cost (ADR-009): header other_cost is allocated to lines PRO-RATA BY LINE VALUE.\n   allocated_i = 300.00 \u00d7 (line_value_i / \u03a3 line_value)\n   landed_unit_cost = unit_cost + (allocated + line_other) / qty_received\nOnly landed_unit_cost reaches inventory \u2014 never the raw unit cost.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Landed cost (ADR-009): header other_cost is allocated to lines PRO-RATA BY LINE VALUE.\n   allocated_i = 300.00 \u00d7 (line_value_i / \u03a3 line_value)\n   landed_unit_cost = unit_cost + (allocated + line_other) / qty_received\nOnly landed_unit_cost reaches inventory \u2014 never the raw unit cost.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
